<title>USA: U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soymeal weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. soybean meal major sales activity in the week ended Sept 26 reported by exporters for the following purchasing countries, in tonnes:</p>
<p>Net Sales:     1995/96		 1996/97</p>
<p> Canada	   55,500     Unknown	65,000</p>
<p> Dominican Rep   2,700     Ukraine	32,800</p>
<p> Venezuela	 2,600     China	  25,000</p>
<p>				   Philippines  15,000</p>
<p>				   Algeria	15,000</p>
<p>Exports of 103,300 tonnes exceeded the previous week by two-thirds and the four week average by 12 percent.</p>
<p>Primary export destinations: Australia, Venezuela and Saudi Arabia.</p>
</text>
